  "description": "Ho-Yeon Baek is fed up with his bad luck. That phony shaman telling him his nightmares are the result of being haunted by spirits was one thing, but sleeping with a hundred different souls in a human body to get rid of those dreams is another! The body in question? Dan Choi, dreamboat celebrity. He’s just as haunted as Ho-Yeon, but that’s nothing compared to the sadness he seems to carry inside. Strange powers brought them together, but could this odd relationship turn into something more?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
